* Backout queue for messages that exceed the redelivery threshold on DEV.QUEUE.1.
DEFINE QLOCAL('DEV.QUEUE.BACKOUT') REPLACE +
    DESCR('Backout queue - messages exceeding BOTHRESH on DEV.QUEUE.1') +
    MAXDEPTH(5000)

* After 3 failed delivery attempts, IBM MQ routes the message here instead of
* redelivering it indefinitely and blocking the consumer.
ALTER QLOCAL('DEV.QUEUE.1') BOTHRESH(3) BOQNAME('DEV.QUEUE.BACKOUT')
